OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786022313
OL,3,CGreat Train Robbery mailbag signed by
OL,4,C10 gang members up for auction
OL,6,FRare memorabilia linked to one of the
OL,7,Fmost famous crimes in British history,
OL,8,Fwhich took place in Buckinghamshire,
OL,9,Fis set to go under the hammer later
OL,10,Fthis month.
OL,12,FA canvas mail bag signed by ten
OL,13,Fmembers of the gang behind the 1963
OL,14,FGreat Train Robbery will feature in an
OL,15,Fauction on 28 August.
OL,17,FThe drawstring bag, similar to those
OL,18,Fhand-stitched by the robbers during
OL,19,Ftheir subsequent prison sentences, is
OL,20,Fbeing offered alongside a photograph
OL,21,Fof the hijacked Royal Mail train.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
